This isn’t our first rodeo. We have helped generations of professionals learn new skills and technologies to compete in each emerging economy. Thousands of Silicon Valley professionals have studied with us and gone on to successful careers. Later, they've returned to develop new skills for the rapid acceleration of development in their field.
Initially, it might be difficult to differentiate between all the new for-profit, online, and onsite corporate training programs that promise swift success.
